WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.501
Let's follow an AI Haeba tool from start to finished result.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:14.658
In the Studio, write what you want in one line and press Make. We'll pick the right tool.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:24.384
To choose yourself, open Tools and pick from the five steps. Going in number order works well.

00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:33.134
Fill in the tool's fields. Your Business Profile fills many for you, and you can leave blanks.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:40.524
Check the estimated credits and press Run. Results usually arrive in one to three minutes.

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:46.939
Each tool shows its result on a screen made for it, saved to your Library automatically.

00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:55.956
Download it as PDF, Word or PowerPoint, or press the next tool to carry on with it pre-filled.

00:00:56.825 --> 00:00:59.476
Now make your first result!
